{"id":"fac_on","lemma":"façon","pos":"noun","rank":252,"glosses":["way; manner; fashion"],"ipa":"/fa.sɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/46/Fr-fa%C3%A7on.ogg/Fr-fa%C3%A7on.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"façons"},"formAudio":{"façons":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/03/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-fa%C3%A7ons.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je ferai ça à ma façon.","en":"I'll do it my way.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},null]},{"text":"Je le préfère de cette façon.","en":"I prefer it that way.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to prefer","l":"préférer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Nous avons des façons de penser différentes.","en":"We have different ways of thinking.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to think"},{"g":"different","l":"différent"}]},{"text":"Faisons-le à ta façon.","en":"Let's do it your way.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Elle voulait sortir, de toutes façons.","en":"She wanted to go out anyway.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to exit"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},null]}]}